tier":"ultra","commission_path":"Auberge → Fora/Virtuoso + wedding DMC","source":"https://aubergeresorts.com/susurros/events/weddings/ (Accessed 2026-07-07)","timing":"December–April","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"\"Whispers of the Heart\" — jungled cliffs to a private beach, event spaces for 30–300, ~45 min from PVR","si":"romance","blurb":"\"Whispers of the Heart\" — jungled cliffs to a private beach, event spaces for 30–300, ~45 min from PVR","when":"December–April","commission":"Auberge → Fora/Virtuoso + wedding DMC","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"name":"Litibú beach","si_tag":"tropical","tier":"premier","commission_path":"villa/resort night + DMC transfer","source":"https://www.puntamita.com/ (Accessed 2026-07-07)","hook":"The quieter, wilder Punta Mita beach — long sand, surf, and the Bahía golf course backdrop; a slower counterpoint to the resort core","si":"tropical","blurb":"The quieter, wilder Punta Mita beach — long sand, surf, and the Bahía golf course backdrop; a slower counterpoint to the resort core","commission":"villa/resort night + DMC transfer","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"name":"El Anclote beach + beach clubs","si_tag":"tropical","tier":"comfort","commission_path":"affiliate dining/activity + resort night","source":"https://thesurfatlas.com/surfing-mexico/punta-mita-surf/ (Accessed 2026-07-07)","hook":"The peninsula''s social beach — beginner surf, beach-club dining, the whale-tour pier","si":"tropical","blurb":"The peninsula''s social beach — beginner surf, beach-club dining, the whale-tour pier","commission":"affiliate dining/activity + resort night","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"name":"Sayulita / San Pancho day","si_tag":"tropical","tier":"comfort","commission_path":"DMC day-tour + affiliate activity","source":"https://www.rivieranayarit.com/activity/water/tour-marietas-island-hidden-beach-punta-mita/ (Accessed 2026-07-07)","timing":"December–April","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"Bohemian surf-and-art villages ~30–45 min north — day-out contrast to Punta Mita polish","si":"tropical","blurb":"Bohemian surf-and-art villages ~30–45 min north — day-out contrast to Punta Mita polish","when":"December–April","commission":"DMC day-tour + affiliate activity","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"name":"Jack Nicklaus Pacífico — Tail of the Whale","si_tag":"expedition","tier":"premier","commission_path":"golf package via resort/DMC + Fora/Virtuoso resort night","source":"https://nicklausdesign.com/course/puntamita/ (Accessed 2026-07-07)","hook":"The world''s only natural-island par-3 green, 199 yds offshore, walkable at low tide; 7,104-yd par-72 with eight ocean holes","si":"expedition","blurb":"The world''s only natural-island par-3 green, 199 yds offshore, walkable at low tide; 7,104-yd par-72 with eight ocean holes","commission":"golf package via resort/DMC + Fora/Virtuoso resort night","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"name":"Bahía course (Nicklaus 2009)","si_tag":"expedition","tier":"premier","commission_path":"golf package + resort","source":"https://nicklausdesign.com/course/puntamita2/ (Accessed 2026-07-07)","timing":"December–April","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"360° Banderas Bay views, a beach hole by the El Faro surf spot; the more technical of the two","si":"expedition","blurb":"360° Banderas Bay views, a beach hole by the El Faro surf spot; the more technical of the two","when":"December–April","commission":"golf package + resort","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"name":"Islas Marietas — Playa del Amor","si_tag":"expedition","tier":"comfort","commission_path":"SEMARNAT-permitted operator (non-commissionable park fee) + resort night","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Islas_Marietas_National_Park (Accessed 2026-07-07)","timing":"December–April","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"SEMARNAT-permitted crater beach reached by swimming a cave tunnel; ~116 visitors/day, Wed–Sun, ~15-min boat","si":"expedition","blurb":"SEMARNAT-permitted crater beach reached by swimming a cave tunnel; ~116 visitors/day, Wed–Sun, ~15-min boat","when":"December–April","commission":"SEMARNAT-permitted operator (non-commissionable park fee) + resort night","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"name":"Humpback whale-watching, Banderas Bay","si_tag":"expedition","tier":"premier","commission_path":"licensed operator + Fora/Virtuoso resort","source":"https://villaexperience.com/whale-watching-punta-mita-guide-2026/ (Accessed 2026-07-07)","hook":"300–500 humpbacks each Dec–Mar; El Anclote pier to sighting zones in 15–30 min","si":"expedition","blurb":"300–500 humpbacks each Dec–Mar; El Anclote pier to sighting zones in 15–30 min","commission":"licensed operator + Fora/Virtuoso resort","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"name":"El Anclote / La Lancha surf","si_tag":"expedition","tier":"comfort","commission_path":"surf school (affiliate/DMC) + resort","source":"https://wildmex.com/activities/surfing-punta-mita-surf-lessons/ (Accessed 2026-07-07)","hook":"Beginner cove + the region''s best peeling waves; guided lessons $60–180 depending on group/private","si":"expedition","blurb":"Beginner cove + the region''s best peeling waves; guided lessons $60–180 depending on group/private","commission":"surf school (affiliate/DMC) + resort","accessed":"2026-07-07"}],"faq":[{"q":"Is Punta Mita safe right now?","a":"Yes — freely bookable. Nayarit carries a US State Dept Level 2 \"Exercise Increased Caution\" advisory (the same tier as France, Germany, Italy and the UK), with no US-government-employee travel restriction and no zones to avoid in the Riviera Nayarit corridor. book_enabled=TRUE, no consent flow.","source":"travel.state.gov, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for?","a":"Rip currents and dengue, not crime. The Pacific beaches have rip currents and shore break — swim guarded resort beaches and obey the flags — and Nayarit is a high-prevalence dengue state with a May–November transmission peak, so pack repellent for summer stays. Nearest full trauma is Puerto Vallarta (~40 min), then US air-evac.","source":"travel.state.gov / cdc.gov, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Is Punta Mita good for a destination wedding?","a":"It is one of Mexico''s ultra-wedding flagships. Susurros del Corazón (Auberge) alone hosts events for 30–300 guests ~45 minutes from PVR, with reception rental from $2,000, alongside Four Seasons and St. Regis event teams. Villa and resort weddings book 9–12 months out — peak-season cohorts 12+ months.","source":"aubergeresorts.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"romance"},{"q":"What''s the best beach and surf for beginners?","a":"El Anclote. It''s a sheltered, sandy-bottom cove with gentle rolling waves — the peninsula''s beginner classroom — while La Lancha, a ~10-minute jungle-trail walk away, holds the most reliable quality waves for confident beginners through intermediates. Guided lessons ($60–180) stage away from the rocks.","source":"thesurfatlas.com / wildmex.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"tropical"},{"q":"Is the golf as good as they say?","a":"Yes — it''s a two-course Nicklaus complex with a genuine one-of-a-kind hole. The Pacífico course (7,104-yd par-72, eight ocean holes) has the \"Tail of the Whale,\" the world''s only natural-island green, 199 yards offshore and walkable at low tide; the 2009 Bahía course is the more technical of the two.","source":"nicklausdesign.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"expedition"},{"q":"How do I actually visit the Islas Marietas Hidden Beach?","a":"Only with a SEMARNAT-permitted operator, and book weeks ahead. Playa del Amor is capped at ~116 visitors/day, Wed–Sun, reached by a ~15-minute boat then a life-jacketed swim through a low cave tunnel; non-swimmers can''t access it. Never promise a landing without a confirmed permitted slot.","source":"en.wikipedia.org, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"ocean-adventures-—-future"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Punta Mita, Mexico — Ultra-Luxury Resorts, Private Villas & Whale Season | TravelWell","search_language":"es-MX","local_keywords":["Punta Mita resorts","villas Punta Mita","Four Seasons Punta Mita","bodas Punta Mita","avistamiento de ballenas Riviera Nayarit","Islas Marietas Playa del Amor","golf Punta Mita"],"hreflang":["en","es-MX"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","author_byline":"By David McCallister — commercial pilot, 56 countries","freshness":"2026-07-07"},"booking":null,"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":null,"ultra":[{"property":"Four Seasons Resort Punta Mita","rooms":"~173 incl. 30 suites + private villas","path":"Fora/Virtuoso","value_add":"FS Preferred credit / upgrade / breakfast","tier":"ultra"},{"property":"The St. Regis Punta Mita","rooms":"89 rooms + 31 suites, butler service","path":"Fora/Virtuoso","value_add":"Marriott Luminous/STARS","tier":"ultra"},{"property":"Susurros del Corazón (Auberge)","rooms":"89 keys (59 rooms/suites + 30 villas)","path":"Fora/Virtuoso + wedding DMC","value_add":"Auberge preferred","tier":"ultra"},{"property":"Conrad Punta de Mita","rooms":"Hilton ultra-resort","path":"Fora/Virtuoso","value_add":"Hilton Impresario","tier":"ultra"},{"property":"Branded private villas (FS / St. Regis / Auberge residences)","rooms":"3–6BR oceanfront estates w/ pools","path":"Fora/Virtuoso or specialist MoR","value_add":"villa-week commission + resort value-add","tier":"ultra"}],"source_verified":null,"hero":{"query":"Punta Mita, Mexico, Mexico"},"geo":{"lat":20.77,"lng":-105.52}}'::jsonb, 88),
  ('quito-ecuador', '10S', 'Quito & the Northern Andes, Ecuador', 'Ecuador', 'Quito & the Northern Andes', 'live', 'verified', 'kyoto', 'Andes (Quito) & Galápagos', '{"culture"}', '{}', '{"essential","comfort"}', null, null, '{"key_facts":null,"safety":{"emergency":"911","advisory_level":"L2","advisory_note":"Mainland L4 (Do Not Travel): Esmeraldas city/north, Guayaquil south of Portete de Tarqui Ave, Durán canton, Huaquillas/Arenillas. Quito/Pichincha not named in any L3/L4 zone.","book_enabled":true,"bin":"freely bookable (L2)","consent_flow":false,"air_access_verified":"UIO — Mariscal Sucre International, Quito (primary gateway to Galápagos + Amazon)","altitude_m":2850,"altitude_notes":{"quito_m":2850,"mild_ams":true,"serious_ams_zones":{"cotopaxi_m":5897,"pichincha_m":4700,"quilotoa_rim_m":3900},"trauma":"Good private hospitals in Quito (Metropolitano, De los Valles, Axxis); serious/altitude cases evac to US (Miami)"},"water":"not reliably potable — bottled/filtered","advisory_source":"https://travel.state.gov/en/international-travel/travel-advisories/ecuador.html (Level 2, issued 2025-10-14)"},"timing":{"peak":["Jun","Jul","Aug","Sep","Dec"],"shoulder_green":["May","Oct","Nov"],"inflection":["Mar","Apr","Oct"],"fire_date":"curve-start minus 1-2 weeks (mid-May for Jun-Sep peak; mid-Nov for Dec/Fiestas) — fire against the Galápagos departure curve when booked as pre/post attach","events":["Fiestas de Quito (early Dec, founding Dec 6)"]},"jewels":[{"name":"La Compañía de Jesús (gold church)","si_tag":"culture","tier":"essential","commission_path":"Guided Old Town tour affiliate (entry non-commissionable)","source":"https://quitotrip.com/things-to-do-in-quito/","timing":"year-round","timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","si":"culture","when":"year-round","commission":"Guided Old Town tour affiliate (entry non-commissionable)"},{"name":"Plaza Grande / Independence Square","si_tag":"culture","tier":"essential","commission_path":"Anchor of guided-tour affiliate","source":"https:/